{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">資深藝人劉兆銘離世，享年94歲。文化體育及旅遊局長羅淑佩表示深切哀悼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉兆銘稱：「造成這個獎的出現，我只是其中一分子。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉兆銘在2013年獲頒「萬千光輝演藝人大獎」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_005.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uEJku6mUHG1788368862.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_005.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他在1970年代起加入無綫，由於年輕時曾隻身到法國習舞，初期擔任舞蹈主任。之後投身影視界，演出多套電視劇及電影，包括《鹿鼎記》的海大富、《倩女幽魂》的千年樹妖姥姥、《千王群英會》的仇大千，多變形象令人印象深刻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026eoWxHuZ6U71788368825.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RLTp1rqxQQ1788368840.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20262Tss560KNJ1788368807.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">參演時裝劇就包括《創世紀II之天地有情》。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026BUxQKkMDxi1788368789.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LAU-0100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他曾獲香港演藝學院頒授榮譽院士、港府的榮譽勳章，為演藝生涯貢獻逾半世紀人生。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T17:24:02.528015+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}